TilesInfo: {
	Spawnpointremoved: Spawn point removed!
	Spawnpointset: Spawn point set!
	EnderMemoryInfo: In memory of a long lost friend still in our hearts.
	DracoAltar1: Geez, kid. Can't a dragon get a little shut-eye? Come back in the morning.
	DracoAltar2: Hey kid, that Sigil only works once, ya know.
	DracoAltar3: Heh, I hope you're ready to feel the fury of the blazing sun kid.
	DracoAltar4: Back for more, kid? Don't you have better things to do? You already beat me once.  Alright, but I won't go easy on you.
	DreadAltar1: NO! I DON'T WANNA FIGHT NOW! I NEED MY BEAUTY SLEEP! COME BACK AT NIGHT!
	DreadAltar2: WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING?! I'M ALREADY HERE!!!
	DreadAltar3: You DARE enter my territory, Terrarian?! NYEHEHEHEHEH..! Big mistake..!
	DreadAltar4: Back for more..?! This time you won't be so lucky you little whelp..!
	DragonEgg1: The sound of the egg breaking echoes through the volcano...
	DragonEgg2: You hear a distant roar...
	DragonEgg3: You hear a tired, quiet roar, and then...snoring..?
	HydraPod1: The contents spill from the broken pod. Nasty.
	HydraPod2: You hear hissing somewhere nearby
	HydraPod3: You hear hissing, but it scuttles away into the fog...
}

GreedChest: {
	MapEntry: Greed Chest
	GreedChest1: The ground below you trembles slightly...
	GreedChest2: You hear a scream echo through the caverns...
	GreedChest3: HANDS OFF MY LOOT YOU THIEVING APE!!!
}